# gamepad, for the web: the Haxe guest compiled to JS, and a wasm host linked to
# exactly the wgrender calls it makes. `haxe build.web.hxml`, then serve
# out/wasm32/release/site; the page loads its assets from assets/ beside it (which
# tools/serve_site.py provides).
-cp src
-lib wgrender-hx
--main Gamepad
--js out/wasm32/release/site/gamepad.js

-D js-es=6
-dce full
-D analyzer-optimize
-D wgr-background=#1c1c26
--macro wgr.macros.WebHost.build()
